---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Watchers in the Dark | Patrick O’Dell">
  <section class="book-page">
    <div class="container">

      <img class="cover" src="/watchers-in-the-dark-cover.jpg" alt="Watchers in the Dark cover" />

      <h1>Watchers in the Dark</h1>
      <p class="series">The Godfire Series</p>

      <p class="blurb">
        Elias Fetch makes a living cleaning up supernatural messes, but even he has limits. When a soft-spoken stranger named Louis arrives in New Orleans with a disturbing problem, Elias is pulled into a case that feels wrong from the start.
      </p>

      <p class="blurb">
        What begins as a routine job unravels into something far older and more dangerous than the city itself.
      </p>

      <p class="blurb">
        As Elias digs deeper, he realizes the truth may be more dangerous than the problem itself.
      </p>

      <div class="actions">
        <a href="#" class="btn">Preorder (Coming Soon)</a>
        <a href="/books" class="btn secondary">Back to Books</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
.book-page { padding: 80px 20px; }
.container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; }
.cover { width: 260px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
.series { opacity: 0.6; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.2em; font-size: 0.8rem; }
.blurb { text-align: left; margin: 16px auto; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 650px; opacity: 0.85; }
.actions { margin-top: 30px; display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; }
.btn { padding: 10px 14px; border: 1px solid black; text-decoration: none; color: black; }
.secondary { opacity: 0.6; }
</style>
